    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT resets state, output, next sample time, and ts.</li>
      <li>OUTPUT emits the stored output. UPDATE runs at sample times.</li>
      <li>At update, y = C*x + D*u and x_next = A*x + B*u; ts is at least 0.001.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y_k = Cx_k + Du_k,\quad x_{k+1} = Ax_k + Bu_k</latex>
